{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24105","headline":"咏史 · 白居易","name":"咏史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦磨利刀斩李斯，齐烧沸鼎烹郦其。\n可怜黄绮入商洛，闲卧白云歌紫芝。\n彼爲葅醢机上尽，此爲鸾皇天外飞。\n去者逍遥来者死，乃知祸福非天爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24105.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24105","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}